{
  "slug": "mattpocock-skills",
  "name": "Matt Pocock Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Matt Pocock's agent skills for real engineering — grilling, spec/ticket flows, TDD, code review, domain modelling and more. Plug-and-play, not vibe coding.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **25 skills** from Matt Pocock's `.agents` directory, named one by one in `plugin.json` so only the promoted set installs:\n\n- **Engineering** (18): `/grill-with-docs`, `/to-spec`, `/to-tickets`, `/implement`, `/tdd`, `/code-review`, `/diagnosing-bugs`, `/domain-modeling`, `/wayfinder`, `/triage`, `/ask-matt` (a router over the rest) and `/setup-matt-pocock-skills`, which configures a repo's tracker, labels and `CONTEXT.md` — run it once first\n- **Productivity** (7): `/grill-me`, `/handoff`, `/teach`, `/to-questionnaire`, `/wait-what`, `/writing-for-agents`\n\nClaude Code only as a plugin; each skill is also in this registry on its own, installable on all five agents.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Matt Pocock"
  },
  "externalUrl": "https://github.com/mattpocock/skills/tree/49dd158d1076134a641b33efb035946536778336",
